sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor CL as Client
    participant API as HTTP API
    participant DB as audit_request / audit
    participant OB as outbox_event
    participant WK as Assignment worker
    participant NT as Notification module
    participant OPS as Report upload (internal)

    CL->>API: POST /v1/audit-requests (siteId)
    API->>DB: INSERT audit_request (PENDING, window frozen)
    API->>OB: INSERT AuditRequestCreated (same transaction)
    API--)DB: NOTIFY assignment_pending
    API-->>CL: 201 PENDING + commitment
    OB--)NT: AuditRequestCreated
    NT->>CL: email - request received

    WK->>DB: claim PENDING (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
    WK->>DB: reuse check - two reads (in-flight, published)
    alt reusable audit
        WK->>DB: audit_request SCHEDULED, audit_id set
    else none
        WK->>DB: INSERT audit (least-loaded auditor, earliest date)
        WK->>DB: audit_request SCHEDULED
    end
    WK->>OB: INSERT AuditRequestScheduled
    OB--)NT: AuditRequestScheduled
    NT->>CL: email - audit scheduled

    Note over OPS,DB: weeks later
    OPS->>API: POST /internal/v1/audits/:id/publication (reportUri)
    API->>DB: audit PUBLISHED, published_at, valid_until
    API->>OB: INSERT AuditPublished (same transaction)
    API->>DB: fan-out - attached requests due become FULFILLED
    API->>OB: INSERT AuditRequestFulfilled (per request)
    API-->>OPS: 200
    OB--)NT: AuditRequestFulfilled
    NT->>CL: email - report ready
